  "headline": "Bareskrim Polri Names Brigjen Tedjo and Kombes Iman Treason Suspects",
  "seoTitle": "Brigjen Tedjo and Kombes Iman Named Treason Suspects",
  "metaDescription": "Bareskrim Polri has named Brigjen Tedjo Kusumo and Kombes Iman Imanuddin as suspects in an alleged treason case involving the surveillance of the President.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Bareskrim Polri named six individuals, including Brigjen Tedjo Kusumo and Kombes Iman Imanuddin, as suspects in an alleged treason case.",
    "The investigation, stemming from illegal surveillance of President Prabowo Subianto, involved searches of 14 locations across multiple regions.",
    "The suspects are currently being held in special quarters by the Police Propam Division and face potential charges of life imprisonment or death."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police's Criminal Investigation Agency (Bareskrim Polri) has officially designated six individuals, including Brigjen Tedjo Kusumo and Kombes Iman Imanuddin, as suspects in a treason investigation. This development follows a broader probe into alleged illegal surveillance targeting President Prabowo Subianto. As part of the ongoing operations, authorities searched 14 locations across Jakarta, Bogor, and Tangerang, identifying five sites that were allegedly used as command posts for the coordination of treasonous activities. According to police, the suspects were involved in criminal conspiracies and coordinated attacks via social media platforms. Following their designation as suspects, both high-ranking officers have been placed under special supervision by the Police's Professional and Security Division (Divpropam). The case continues to be investigated by police officials to determine the full scope of the alleged conspiracy and the specific roles played by those involved.",
